aline: Heads-up: I'm planting a small docs PR to clarify SDK behavior on 429 + timeouts + context fallbacks. Will add a compact TypeScript snippet showing Retry-After + context trim. Looking for a quick pair of reviewers + a link fix for the errref anchor.
